5,0,1,talk,Minato,,I’m Minato! I’m really curious about how this game works. What should we do first?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Ah, Minato, curiosity is a virtue. Let’s simply observe. I suspect the night holds more answers than our current chatter.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Young ones, patience is the root of wisdom. Let us listen to the silence before the storm breaks.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Oh, look at all this wisdom. I’m just here to have fun, not write a philosophy thesis. Let’s keep it light!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I’m Takumi! I’m ready to fight. Who’s the wolf? Let’s find out and win!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I agree with Benjamin. Maybe we should just wait and see what happens tonight?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. Let the night reveal its secrets. I’ll be watching closely, Minato.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Benjamin. The night is a great teacher. Let us trust the process and remain calm.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"I’m not a philosopher, but I agree. Let’s see who blinks first.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I’m not waiting around! We need to talk more. Who here seems suspicious? I want to protect my friends!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I don’t know who is suspicious yet. I just want to understand the rules better.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Patience, Takumi. Accusations without evidence are just noise. Let us wait for the night to speak before we judge.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your zeal is admirable, but wisdom demands we wait. Let the night reveal the truth before we act.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"Takumi, relax. You’re barking up the wrong tree. Let’s actually listen to the adults for once, shall we?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, I’ll listen. But if anyone lies, I’m calling it out. I’m not letting the wolf win easily!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I think waiting is good. I don’t want to make a mistake. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Goodnight, everyone. May the truth find us in the morning.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Goodnight, dear friends. May the stars guide us toward clarity. Rest well.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, you wise owls. I’ll be up all night plotting my next move. Sweet dreams!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight! I’ll be watching you all closely. No one gets away with hiding.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
