31,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m Minato. I’m still a bit confused about what happened last night. Did anyone see anything strange?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Minato, your confusion is noted. I have my own insights, but I’ll keep them to myself for now. Let’s observe.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,The night whispers to those who listen. I sense a heavy shadow lingering near our youngest. Let us tread carefully.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Servas, really? Shadowy poetry? I’m just a villager, not a cryptid. Let’s stick to facts, please.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, stop with the riddles! I don’t like your tone. @Minato, are you okay? You seem confused.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I’m okay, Takumi. I’m just trying to understand everything. I don’t know what to do yet.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Minato, your honesty is refreshing. But be careful; wolves often hide behind innocence. I have data, but I need time to process it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, your caution is wise. Yet, shadows are not always wolves. Let us seek truth, not fear, in our words.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"Benjamin, stop with the vague ""data"" talk. It’s creepy. I’m just a villager, so I’m safe, right?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, stop being so mysterious! If you know something, say it! We need facts, not riddles. Who is the wolf?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,I don’t know who the wolf is. I just want to help. Please don’t be so mean to each other.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Minato, please. I am not being mean, merely precise. Takumi, your impatience is noted, but facts require time to mature.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your passion is a fire, but it must be guided. Benjamin, your silence is a shield. Let us seek unity, not division.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"Benjamin, your ""maturity"" comment is painfully slow. I’m just a villager, so I’m safe, right? Let’s stop stalling and find the wolf!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop asking if you’re safe! It’s suspicious. @Benjamin, if you have proof, share it now. We can’t waste time!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,I’m sorry for the tension. I just want us to be friends. Please don’t fight. I’ll try to listen more carefully today.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Minato, your kindness is a balm. But kindness won’t stop the wolf. I’ll reveal my findings soon. Stay sharp.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Minato, your peace is precious. Yet, peace without vigilance is merely sleep. Let us find the truth together.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"Benjamin, you’re the only one with actual information. Stop teasing us and tell us who you checked!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, I’m done waiting! If you’re the Seer, say it now. We need to vote before nightfall!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
